        "faq_zw9dQJ": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the difference between The Insider, The Innerweave, The Outlier, and The Porter?",
            "title_richtext": "",
            "answer": "<p>The Insider and Innerweave are designed for indoor (and indoor/outdoor, for the Innerweave) spaces like entryways and mudrooms; The Outlier and The Porter are built for full outdoor exposure year-round, with The Porter's hand-knotted Italian construction offering our most refined outdoor option.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_XwCwAp": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Porte + Hall doormats durable enough for daily outdoor use?",
            "title_richtext": "<p><br/><br/></p>",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The Outlier is built with all-weather construction and drainage channels, backed by a 5-year warranty, while The Porter is hand-knotted from 100% Italian yarns designed to repel moisture and resist fading. Both are made to hold up through changing seasons, not just look good on day one.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_NgVC6w": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How thin are Porte + Hall doormats, and will they fit tight doorways?",
            "title_richtext": "",
            "answer": "<p>The Insider is our lowest-profile option — woven in Italy with a slip-resistant latex backing, designed to clear tight door swings without sacrificing durability. It's built to take on daily mud, boots, and pets while staying easy to live with.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_cPWFm3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Porte + Hall doormats easy to clean?",
            "title_richtext": "",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, though care varies by style: indoor mats like The Insider and The Innerweave shake out and spot-clean with a damp cloth, while outdoor styles like The Outlier can be hosed down or pressure washed. None require machine washing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_zdLBe9": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Porte + Hall doormats worth the investment?",
            "title_richtext": "",
            "answer": "<p>Our customers think so — 81% of over 3,900 verified reviews are five stars. That reflects what's behind each mat: Italian-woven or hand-knotted materials and, on The Outlier, a 5-year warranty — built to perform for years, not a season.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
